<view class="shell">
<view class="eyebrow">SHU TRADE ROUTES / V0.1</view>
<view xhs:if="{{screen === 'home'}}" class="hero"><view class="seal">蜀地 · 行商札记</view><view class="title">蜀地钱路</view><view>钱有轻重，路有取舍。</view><view class="muted">一袋铁钱，一纸交子。在北宋蜀地的街巷间，走通你的第一笔生意。</view><view class="art"><view class="coin">□</view><view class="ticket">交 子<view class="muted">便商旅 · 通有无</view></view></view><button class="primary" data-action="intro" bindtap="onAction">开始游戏 →</button><view class="muted">第一关 · 约 3 分钟 · 可随时撤销</view></view>
<view xhs:elif="{{screen === 'intro'}}"><view class="subtitle">第一关 · 一车铁钱</view><view>天色尚早，货仓的八枚铁钱已备齐。受人之托，你要买一匹布，送往城中的交付点。</view><view class="card"><view class="seal">今日委托</view><view class="subtitle">四步之内，将布送达。</view><view>钱袋只能承重五格。桥上路短，却要一枚铁钱；街巷免费，但要多走一步。</view></view><view class="rules">{{rulesText}}</view><button class="primary" data-action="play" bindtap="onAction">整理钱袋 →</button></view>
<view xhs:else><view class="row"><view class="subtitle">一车铁钱</view><view class="seal">委托 壹</view></view>
<view xhs:if="{{s.status !== 'playing'}}" class="card"><view class="title">{{s.status === 'won' ? '布已送达' : '行程未成'}}</view><view>{{s.status === 'won' ? '这一程，钱与路都安排妥当。' : '四步已用尽，未能携布抵达。换一种钱袋或商路再试一次。'}}</view><view class="stats"><view class="stat">行动步数<view class="number">{{s.steps}} / 4</view></view><view class="stat">剩余资金<view class="number">{{s.iron + s.note}}</view></view></view><view>{{s.iron}} 铁钱 · {{s.note}} 交子</view><view class="path">{{pathText}}</view><button class="primary" data-action="retry" bindtap="onAction">重新挑战</button><button class="primary" data-action="undo" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{!canUndo}}">撤销上一步</button></view>
<view xhs:else><view class="muted">{{s.bought ? '将布料送往交付点' : '购买一份布料，并在四步内交付'}}</view><view class="stats"><view class="stat"><view class="label">行动步数</view><text class="number">{{s.steps}}</text> / 4</view><view class="stat"><view class="label">钱袋负重</view><text class="number">{{weight}}</text> / 5</view></view>
<view class="map"><view xhs:for="{{edges}}" xhs:key="key" class="route {{item.kind}}" style="{{item.style}}"></view><button xhs:for="{{nodes}}" xhs:key="id" class="node {{item.current ? 'current' : ''}} {{item.reachable ? 'reachable' : ''}}" style="{{item.style}}" data-node="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onMove"><view class="symbol">{{item.symbol}}</view>{{item.name}}{{item.toll ? ' · 1钱' : ''}}</button><view class="mapcaption">金边可达 · 蓝底所在 · 每段道路 1 步</view></view>
<view class="wallet"><view class="walletitem">□ {{s.iron}}<view class="label">铁钱 · 每枚重 1</view></view><view class="walletitem">▤ {{s.note}}<view class="label">交子 · 不占负重</view></view><view class="walletitem">▱ {{s.cloth}}<view class="label">布料 · 每份重 2</view></view></view>
<view class="feedback {{error ? 'error' : ''}}">{{message}}</view>
<view xhs:if="{{!s.departed}}" class="card"><view class="row"><text>货仓 · 出发准备</text><text class="muted">手续费 1</text></view><view xhs:if="{{!s.exchanged}}"><view class="stepper"><button class="small" data-action="x-" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{x &lt;= 2}}">−</button><text>兑换 {{x}} 铁钱</text><button class="small" data-action="x+" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{x >= s.iron}}">+</button></view><view class="muted">{{exchangeText}}</view><button class="primary" data-action="exchange" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{!exchangeOk}}">确认兑换</button></view><view xhs:else>已完成兑换，本次出发前不能再次兑换。</view><button class="primary" data-action="depart" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{weight > 5}}">确认出发</button><view xhs:if="{{weight > 5}}" class="muted">仍然超重：所有剩余铁钱都需要携带。</view></view>
<view xhs:if="{{s.location === 'shop' &amp;&amp; !s.bought}}" class="card"><view>布铺 · 布料价 6，重 2</view><view class="muted">至少支付 2 铁钱，其余可用交子。</view><view class="stepper"><button class="small" data-action="p-" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{p &lt;= 0}}">−</button><text>{{p}} 铁钱 + {{payNote}} 交子</text><button class="small" data-action="p+" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{p >= 6}}">+</button></view><view class="muted">{{buyText}}</view><button class="primary" data-action="buy" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{!buyOk}}">确认购买布料</button></view>
<button xhs:if="{{s.location === 'delivery'}}" class="primary" data-action="deliver" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{!s.bought}}">{{s.bought ? '交付布料 · 完成委托' : '尚未购得布料'}}</button>
<view class="controls"><button class="secondary" data-action="undo" bindtap="onAction" disabled="{{!canUndo}}">撤销</button><button class="secondary" data-action="retry" bindtap="onAction">重试</button><button class="secondary" data-action="rules" bindtap="onAction">规则</button></view></view></view>
<view xhs:if="{{rules}}" class="card rules"><view>行商须知</view><view>{{rulesText}}</view><button class="secondary" data-action="rules" bindtap="onAction">收起规则</button></view><view class="footer">临时视觉原型 · 非历史币值模拟</view></view>
